<%= @opened_by ? "#{@opened_by.nickname} started a password reset for your #{@tenant_name} account." : "Somebody asked to reset the password for your #{@tenant_name} account." %>

Open the link below to choose a new one. Signing in everywhere else stops
working the moment you do.

<%= @url %>

The link works once, and expires in <%= ActiveSupport::Duration.build(PasswordReset.lifetime.to_i).inspect %>.
If this was not you, nothing has changed yet and you can ignore it. Your
password only changes when somebody opens the link and sets a new one.
